$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag Ground";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Priam IV" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Hazy" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Day" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> tribes are battling for survival on the remote planet of Priam IV.  Each team must grab the other's flag and successfully bring it back to their base, touching it to their own flag to capture. The 3 Towers at the Front Line could prove to be a major part in this battle. Good Luck!" @
	 "\n\n<f1>Map By:<f4> Lisa W.  (XGN LadyShar) Pick up all my Tribes Maps at http://welcome.to/LadyShars" @
         "\n\n<f1> Custom Maps: <f0> Need a custom map for your Tribe or Server, head on over to Mappers Extreme site at http://www.planetstarsiege.com/extreme";